的小阳台，兼具功能性与美感，植物层层叠叠且排列有致，绿色的生命力与周围建筑的灰白色调形成鲜明对比，显得格外鲜活。而阳台本身的有限空间得到了充分利用，既展示了主人对植物的喜爱，也体现了一种兼顾自然与城市生活的生活方式。图片整体给人一种宁静怡人的感受，让人仿佛也能通过屏幕感受到阳光洒落在绿植上的暖意。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 73, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [382.5130920410156, 345.6866760253906], "pos": [2138.889404296875, 2305.5556640625], "id": 48, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 12}, {"outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [124], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "LATENT"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": [768, 1152, 1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "label": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "batch_size"}], "flags": {}, "type": "EmptyLatentImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [400.21136474609375, 106], "pos": [1369.1429443359375, 3261.416259765625], "id": 79, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "EmptyLatentImage"}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [72], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["色调艳丽，过曝，静态，细节模糊不清，字幕，风格，作品，画作，画面，静止，整体发灰，最差质量，低质量，JPEG压缩残留，丑陋的，残缺的，多余的手指，画得不好的手部，画得不好的脸部，畸形的，毁容的，形态畸形的肢体，手指融合，静止不动的画面，杂乱的背景，三条腿，背景人很多，倒着走"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 76, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [445.8922119140625, 108.65225982666016], "pos"